# Facts about Old Pell.

@fact pell.apothecary
tier: surface
text: Runs the drawers at Pell & Daughters. He taught three generations of the village to count drops.

@fact pell.counting
tier: personal
hint: Count with him.
unlock: seen(pell_count_drops) > 0
text: He makes every new clerk count aloud. He trusts people who measure twice.

@fact pell.daughters
tier: personal
hint: Meet the daughters behind the counter.
unlock: seen(pell_daughters) > 0
text: His daughters run the counter and want the shop to change; he wants it to be fifty years ago. They're all secretly proud of each other.

@fact pell.spoon
tier: personal
hint: Ask about the brass spoon.
unlock: seen(offer_measuring_spoon) > 0
text: His brass measuring spoon hasn't been wrong in forty years. His daughters learned to measure on it, and say it's theirs.
